function [s] = sils_forces(cr)
%SILS_FORCES  The SILS force set of asils.orbit.init, the solar pressure's Cr given: the degree and order 6 field, Battin's Sun and
%   Moon, cannonball drag in DTM2020 with the air turning with the Earth (forces.drag's gsi), cannonball solar pressure
%   in the conical shadow; no Earth radiation, relativity, tides or empirical acceleration.
%   cr: real[1] (passed a plain number)
%   returns s: ForceSet (passed rec)
%   Generated by tools/pcode.py from the pseudocode (trinetra-pcode/2); do not edit.
